From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 00:26:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on the Acer Aspire 14 AI
 and 16 AI

Allow QSEECOM on the Acer Aspire 14 AI and Aspire 16 AI, for access to
the UEFI variables. Without them, an install on the Aspire 16 AI failed
when the installer wrote its boot entry ("EFI variables are not
supported on this system").

Neither laptop has run with QSEECOM enabled yet.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 42838a3..389d91c 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2300,6 +2300,8 @@ EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(qcom_scm_qseecom_app_send);
  + any potential issues with this, only allow validated machines for now.
  */
 static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
+	{ .compatible = "acer,aspire-a14-11m" },
+	{ .compatible = "acer,aspire-a16-11m" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15-x1p4" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407qa" },
-- 
2.55.0

